TI  - Debate-of-Thoughts: Resolving Knowledge Conflicts in LLMs Through Internal Deliberation
AU  - Li, Guocong
AU  - Hu, Qirui
AU  - Wang, Ping
AU  - Zhang, Guofeng
AU  - Wu, Jian
AU  - Xu, Hongxia
