TI  - A Proposal for Evaluating the Linguistic Quality of Synthetic Spanish Corpora
AU  - Sevilla-Requena, Lucia
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/September
T2  - Proceedings of the 9th Student Research Workshop associated with the International Conference Recent Advances in Natural Language Processing
SP  - 54
EP  - 61
