TY  - CONF
TI  - MetaScientist: A Human-AI Synergistic Framework for Automated Mechanical Metamaterial Design
AU  - Qi, Jingyuan
AU  - Jia, Zian
AU  - Liu, Minqian
AU  - Zhan, Wangzhi
AU  - Zhang, Junkai
